    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A hardy sprig of mistletoe, holly, or some other sacred leaf, picked from a tree whose roots are sunken deep into a ley line. Those who heed nature's call are able to harness this connection to call forth the incredible power of nature.</p>\n<p><strong>Spellcasting Focus</strong>. A druidic focus is a special item designed to channel the power of spells from the druid's spell list. A druid can use such an item as a spellcasting focus, using it in place of any material component which does not list a cost.</p>",
